@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

hide footbox
autonumber

title US020 SSD - As a user, I want to get a list (name and user) of the publicly published lists of a given genre

actor User
participant ":System" as System

activate User
activate System

User --> System: I want to see public lists of a certain genre

System --> User: Select genre (List<Genre>)

User --> System: Selected! (genreId)

System -->  User: Done! (List<US020CollectionOfPublicationsDTO>)


@enduml